<title>USA: Media General Q1 oper shr lower at $0.31.</title>
<headline>Media General Q1 oper shr lower at $0.31.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $2.06   profit	 $0.57</p>
<p> Net loss		  54,767   profit	15,056</p>
<p> Revs		     216,100		  184,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs			NA			 NA</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Media General Inc.</p>
<p>1997 Q1 includes extraordinary charge of $63 million or $2.37 a share. Charge is due to redemption of high coupon debt assumed on January 7 in connection with an acquisition. Excluding the charge, income would have been $8.2 million or $0.31 a share.</p>
<p>1997 Q1 revenues include operations of recently acquired Park television and newspapers properties.</p>
